mean TPOT: within 20% of measured in 13 of the 13 five-minute steps scored (a figure, and enough measured requests); no overall lean (median ratio 0.99). p90 TPOT not scored in 8: the measured p90 fell in a histogram bucket wider than 20% of its lower edge, too wide to place it, with the prediction inside it or within 20% of its edge; in the measured histogram bucket itself in 8, 10 ms to 20 ms (2.0x wide): consistent at the bucket's resolution, not within 20%. To measure it, give the histogram finer edges: the router's metrics.requestTPOTBuckets in the EndpointPickerConfig (an llm-d-router build after v1.0.0), or vLLM's --custom-histogram-buckets (v0.32.0 and later). Edges about 15% apart place p90 and p95 within 20%.
